'''Gurglings''' are a [[boss]] that can appear:
* {{Dlc|nr}} Only in the {{s|Basement}}.
* {{Dlc+|r}} In the {{s|Basement}} and the {{s|Burning Basement}}.{{dlc-}}
They each have {{dlc|na}} 90 HP / {{dlc|a}} 60 HP.

== Behavior ==
The Gurglings spawn as a pair and wander around the room. Each individual Gurgling has one attack in total which is performed independently of the other:
* Rushes towards the player when aligned in any cardinal direction, leaving behind damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] until they have run into a wall.
** After rushing into a wall, they pause for a brief moment, and then spawn 0-2 {{e|Attack Fly|text=Attack Flies}}.
** Their dash can be interrupted if they run into an Attack Fly.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|18|dlc=a}}: Gurglings spawn {{e|Troll Bomb}}s at regular intervals instead of Red Creep when rushing towards the player. They take only 5 damage from their own bombs. They don't spawn any Attack Flies.
:* While [[Status Effects#Petrification|petrified]], the Gurglings take full damage from their own bombs.
: {{bc|12|dlc=a}}: Three Gurglings will appear instead of two. They are faster but do not leave any Creep. They don't spawn any Attack Flies.

