== Trivia ==
* Gurglings appear to be the first stage of the "Gurdy" boss line, with the second stage as {{e|Gurdy Jr.}}, the third as {{e|Gurdy}}, and the final as {{e|Mama Gurdy}}.
** With the {{e|Turdlings}}, the Gurdy boss series has a total of five bosses, the second most out of any boss in the game after the Harbingers and the most out of floor-specific bosses.
* The Gurglings and {{dlc+|a}} their poop-themed variant, the {{e|Turdlings}}{{dlc-}}, spawn in groups of three during the Boss Rush.
* If the Gurglings' audio is slowed down, the audio reveals that it is a little kid saying "Rawr!"
* Unlike the regular {{E|Gurgling}}, boss Gurglings have a one-second death animation.
* In the game files, the Gurglings' feet are called hands.

